Backport of llvm/llvm-project#191091, "[ObjC] Fix missing ptrauth signing of isa in constant ObjC literals" (merged 2026-04-21), to
swiftlang/llvm-project swift-6.4.0-RELEASE (docs/adr/0170-xcodes-clang-abi-and-a-patched-clang.md, B-170).

diff --git a/clang/lib/CodeGen/CGObjCMac.cpp b/clang/lib/CodeGen/CGObjCMac.cpp
